{"groupKey":"default:654219894","nextSeq":2534,"entries":[{"seq":2465,"messageId":"1505399887","ts":1793234748000,"userId":"2226997440","nickname":"AAA歪歪批发","text":" [图片: https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&fileid=EhTSCI1jg-vpfLo7pLSbTcSMCwzCcBjI_hYg_wootsXBgIDelwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQMLk-lkUIo6sP-zMDLOT-h3oCld6CAQJneg&rkey=CAISMMVczUIidcznPIaMxage1enn0UYXwiet1KFg-GLoi3Fe8LYEnk6_cZWUSofhBL3Hmw]","imageCount":1,"self":false,"media":[{"path":"/home/icy/.openclaw/media/inbound/qq/08e864870303c7142ab09793b22327c20ce50049.jpg","type":"image/jpeg"}],"injected":true},{"seq":2466,"messageId":"489817524","ts":1793234984000,"userId":"1074035804","nickname":"该群已被群主解散（-5.2kg）","text":" @海盐  这是啥","replyToSeq":2463,"imageCount":0,"self":false,"injected":true},{"seq":2467,"messageId":"294518975","ts":1793234991000,"userId":"3883176878","nickname":"海盐","text":"我猜你说的是上面那句“agent swarm”，对吧。简单说，就是放一窝子代理一起干活：一个总管负责拆任务，几个小的分头并行去做，最后再把结果收回来。\n和单个助手比起来，好处是能同时铺开好几条线，也能给每条线配不同的专长；代价是调度和汇总都得管好，不然容易各说各话。\n放在群里的实际用法，大概就是“一件事拆给几个人同时查”，等结果回来再拼成一句能看的话。","imageCount":0,"self":false,"injected":true},{"seq":2468,"messageId":"1211036095","ts":1793235047000,"userId":"1074035804","nickname":"该群已被群主解散（-5.2kg）","text":"嗷  多子agent","imageCount":0,"self":false,"injected":true},{"seq":2469,"messageId":"665890895","ts":1793235262000,"userId":"2226997440","nickname":"AAA歪歪批发","text":"嗯，就是claude的那种","imageCount":0,"self":false,"injected":true},{"seq":2470,"messageId":"1819025549","ts":1793235288000,"userId":"2226997440","nickname":"AAA歪歪批发","text":"特别是moe模型，注意力本来就有限的情况下","imageCount":0,"self":false,"injected":true},{"seq":2471,"messageId":"self-1793235422444","ts":1793235422444,"userId":"3480164230","nickname":"我(Cody)","text":"就是那套，总管拆题、小的分头跑、回来拼。烧钱主要烧在每条子线都得重新读一遍上下文，四路并行就是四份，速度换token。我家那台现在是拿缓存命中在补这个窟窿","imageCount":0,"self":true,"injected":true},{"seq":2472,"messageId":"43404610","ts":1793236846000,"userId":"1074035804","nickname":"该群已被群主解散（-5.2kg）","text":" @海盐  帮我生仔  哇嘎嘎嘎","replyToSeq":2467,"im